{"product_id":"baby-s-first-book","title":"Baby’s First Book","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"186\"\u003eA beautiful first book to share with your little one.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"491\"\u003e\u003cem data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"207\"\u003eBaby’s First Book\u003c\/em\u003e by Clare Beaton is a delightful introduction to the world of books for babies and toddlers. Featuring soft, hand-stitched felt illustrations, bright colors, and simple text, this book engages little eyes and hands while encouraging early learning and bonding through reading.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"671\"\u003eEach page showcases familiar objects, animals, and everyday scenes—perfect for developing your baby's vocabulary, recognition skills, and love of stories from the very beginning.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"743\"\u003eA keepsake-quality board book that’s as charming as it is educational.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"844\"\u003eAuthor: Clare Beaton\u003cbr data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"772\"\u003eISBN: 9781905236046\u003cbr data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"798\"\u003eFormat: \u003cbr data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"823\"\u003ePages: \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45621230272665,"sku":"1RG9098765","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/3165130.jpg?v=1754484997","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/baby-s-first-book","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}